{
  "body" : "Ultra-detailed fantasy travel poster for {{destination}}, featuring a floating Jack of Spades playing card transformed into an intricate 3D paper-cut diorama. The card is labeled with the destination name from {{destination}}, using local language characters when appropriate. Inside the card, automatically create a breathtaking miniature landscape that fits this specific city or destination: its most recognizable landmarks, skyline or natural scenery, local architecture, regional plants, water or mountain features if relevant, pathways, transport, and small travel details that make the place instantly identifiable. A lone traveler with a suitcase stands at the threshold of the scene, gazing into the diorama, creating a sense of adventure and wanderlust.\n\nSurrounding the card are destination-specific travel memorabilia: floating seasonal petals or leaves, a delicate local paper object or cultural motif, vintage travel stamps, passport-style arrival seals, transit tickets, boarding passes, maps, luggage tags, and small souvenir fragments that match {{destination}}. The background shows soft-focus scenery from the same destination with dreamy bokeh, atmospheric haze, and warm cinematic lighting. The composition combines paper craft art, travel memorabilia, and luxury editorial design.\n\nUltra-realistic, hyper-detailed, layered papercraft effect, depth and dimension, premium travel advertisement, whimsical storytelling, cinematic atmosphere, soft volumetric light, shallow depth of field, vibrant yet elegant color grading, masterpiece, 8K, vertical composition, highly shareable social media artwork, magical travel destination poster.",
